# A loaded save stands at its saved height where a tile has two levels, and knows whether it is on the
# bridge or under it (the DS saves the player's y and MAP_OBJ_STATUS_ON_ELEVATED_BRIDGE; docs/decisions.md).
set state repel 250
# Route 212 South: under the bike bridge (BIKE_BRIDGE_E_W: deck at 48, path at 16). A walker under it may cross
# its tiles east–west; on the deck (elevated) a walker could not. A reload keeps the player under it.
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_212_SOUTH 482 846 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 482 845
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press right
until position 483 845
+0 release right
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state player.y 16
+0 press right
until position 484 845 120
+0 release right
until idle
